\subsection{Method \code{fit_linearity_regression()}}{
Fit the linearity regression of bias on reference value.

Fits \code{lm(bias ~ reference)} on \strong{all individual measurement biases}
(not on per-reference means), per Minitab's methods and formulas.
Then derives:
\itemize{
\item Linearity = |slope| * Process Variation
\item \%Linearity = Linearity / Process Variation * 100 = |slope| * 100
\item Linearity 95\% CI from the slope CI: |slope_CI| * PV
\item Slope / Intercept t-tests and p-values
}

Requires \code{\link[=compute_per_reference_summary]{compute_per_reference_summary()}} to have been called first.
